#: nmb/help.py:24
msgid "When powers are on, the rules every player reads say that a god may act in this game, that the god could be watching or sitting at the table, and that nobody knows who. Everything a power does reaches the players as the doing of 「신」, the god, and nothing more. A power you use while playing takes effect at the game's next step, the same as a spectator's, so its timing does not point to your seat. Only the record and your own screen say who used it."
